n\nWith intuitive navigation, you can use an interactive map to explore each corner of the Al-Aqsa compound. As you walk, you'll find informative icons that reveal cultural insights and historical context at each landmark. This blend of free exploration and guided discovery lets you experience the serene ambiance and spiritual significance of this revered Islamic site.\n\nIn every corner of this virtual world, history unfolds, inviting you to connect with the timeless beauty of Al-Aqsa in a whole new way.", "short_description": "Step into the history and heritage of Al-Aqsa Mosque through an immersive virtual reality experience. Navigate its landmarks, unlock historical insights, and feel the sacred atmosphere, all from your headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.aqsareality.com/pages/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Center for Islam in the Contemporary World", "support_website_url": "https://www.aqsareality.com/", "website_url": "https://www.sirajstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25642433245419980"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2300018690471069"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2300018690471069"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769506380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2300018690